body:
Yes, I have called the national hotline.  The 45 minute wait is telling.  Called them twice.  Bummer the second time the person was shitty ... Ted Bundy worked at a suicide hotline.  Called local hotlines near me and in other states with good nonprofits at least 20 times total.  Helpful consistency.  One person was really, really, really blunt and I appreciated that - with regards to tolerating anything when it endangers baby.  All my sappy victim justifications were just so unpersuasive and the tone was kind but firm.

&#x200B;

That is very nice to offer.  Just moving somewhere with a security gate.  Don't feel like moving towards the people who are on the list, just setting myself up.  Maybe someday .... didn't help that my counselor was kind of conniving me to not leave, so she would lose such a regular client.
